From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] dnsapi: DNS dynamic update for DnsModifyRecordsInSet and DnsReplaceRecordSet (6070)

They said success and sent nothing. The update (RFC 2136) goes to the
primary server of the zone that holds the name, found through its SOA
record: the deletions, then the additions, or the whole set replaced;
the server's response code is the result. Updates are unsigned: a
secure-only update fails with ERROR_NOT_SUPPORTED.
---
